    "updated_at": "2026-05-06T02:51:45Z",
    "body": "If I understood your problem, may this be a solution?\n```\n  <form id=\"settings\">\n    <input type=\"text\" name=\"username\"> <!-- Submitted -->\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"uiToggle\" form=\"nosubmit\"> <!-- Not submitted -->\n  </form>\n  <form id=\"nosubmit\"</form>\n```",
